      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there is no \"moving forward\" from this? sometimes when you break something fundamental, you can't just glue it back together. the damage is done and it's just... out there now. i feel like a parasite. i look at the world and i just feel like my existence is actively making it worse. i don't want to \"grow\" from this, i just want the weight to stop. i just want to stop being a burden to everyone around me.",
